// pfodWeb NOTE: excludes GPIO21 (TLV320DAC3101 reset, default-connected
// solder bridge), GPIO5-7 (dedicated DAC I2S bus), GPIO10-13 (dedicated
// microSD SPI bus) - see vendor pins_arduino.h comments.
// pfodWeb NOTE: GPIO47 tagged "led_high" (status LED labeled 'IO47', confirmed
// via yellobyte/YB-ESP32-S3-DAC README + schematic sheet 1/2 "Status LED
// (GPIO47)" section: GPIO47 -> R7 5.1k -> LED -> GND, i.e. LED lights when
// GPIO47 is driven HIGH). GPIO0 "BOOT" pushbutton NOT tagged - vendor README
// documents it only as "shorts GPIO0 to ground... combination [with reset] is
// used to force the board into boot mode", not as a general-purpose user
// button - left for human review, see notes.txt.
